  "seo": {
    "title": "Pokémon TCG Shrouded Fable Checklist · All 99 Cards",
    "description": "Free checklist for the Pokémon TCG Shrouded Fable set. Track all 99 cards, or go further with every reverse holos and every special print, with images, copy counts, binder pages and prices. No sign-up needed.",
    "ogTitle": "Pokémon TCG Shrouded Fable Checklist",
    "ogDescription": "Track all 99 cards in Pokémon TCG Shrouded Fable: the 64-card main set and 35 secret rares, plus 55 reverse holos for a master set and 3 special prints for a grand master set. Free, no sign-up, works offline.",
    "twitterDescription": "Track all 99 cards in Pokémon TCG Shrouded Fable. Free, no sign-up, works offline."
  },
  "about": {
    "title": "About the Shrouded Fable set",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Pokémon TCG: Shrouded Fable is a Scarlet & Violet expansion released on 2 August 2024. It has 99 cards: 64 in the main set and 35 secret rares. For a master set there are also 55 reverse holos, and 3 special prints from other products and events.",
      "Choose what you’re collecting: the <b>Standard set</b> (the 64 main set cards), the <b>Complete set</b> (all 99 cards), the <b>Master set</b> (154 cards, adding every reverse holos) or the <b>Grand Master set</b> (157 cards, adding the 3 special prints (stamped, Cosmos Holo and other product-exclusive cards)).",
      "This free checklist lets you tick off the cards you own, count spare copies for trading, see your progress by rarity and plan your binder pages. It works on phones and computers, even offline, and your collection stays on your device."
    ]
  },
